      <activity id="b0adca02-e570-5aef-9222-f3c6a20c0ff3" activityNameId="fbbda683-d607-53e5-b82e-e97e82e36a0c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Furnace, wood chips, mixed, 1000kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Furnace, wood chips, mixed, 1000kW
Inventory refers to the production of a wood chips furnace 1MW. Composition of the previous inventory was used and updated with the average weight of current wood chips furnaces available in Switzerland.\nTechnology: average technology\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nSynonyms: In UVEK2018 enthalten\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Holzenergie\nLocal subcategory: Heizungssysteme\nUVEK 2022 source file:EcoSpold_furnace_wood chips_1000kW_v0.3_gr_lwa.xml\n\n
Synonyms: In UVEK2018 enthalten; 
UUID: 4f86426a-e9a6-38c8-8eb1-b2d759e37b1b
Includes materials, transports and energy used for the fabrication of the furnace, the chimney, the storage silo, the automatic fuel supply and the automatic control technique.
Location: undefined
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4f86426a-e9a6-38c8-8eb1-b2d759e37b1b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
